/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Institution :   Birla Institute of Technology, Jaipur Campus is an integral part of Birla Institute of Technology, Mesra \(Ranchi\) which is one of the reputed academic institutions in India, founded in 1955 by renowned visionary-industrialist Shri. B.M. Birla, as a premier institution for Engineering & Management education. The institute has proud legacy of inherent academic and research strengths with a broad dynamic vision of consistent excellence. The BIT Jaipur Campus follows same norms and high standards of the main campus at Mesra with respect to courses, examinations, teaching, research, campus placement, faculty and lab infrastructure etc. The students get BIT Mesra Degree. )
