/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (1. Before participating in any academic event viz. examination, seminar and other activity of different UG or PG programme of our Institute the student must register the offered courses of that session. The Institute follows a semester system. In one academic year there are two semesters of six months duration. The academic year commences from July and ends in June. The semester starting from July and ending in December is termed as Monsoon Semester \(session MO\) and the semester starting from January and ending in May is termed as Spring Semester \(Session SP\). The Institute also has provision for Summer Short Semester to facilitate clearance of backlogs if required. The students who have not passed the examination in regular semester in one attempt can register their backlog subjects in short-semester examination conducted in the month of June every year. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
